# UniControl DSL Script Example
# This script demonstrates automating Excel

# Launch the application
launch Excel
wait 2

log Clicking Blank Sheet tab
find Blank Workbook role: AXButton
click
wait 1

# Navigate to Developer tab
log Clicking Developer tab
find Developer role: AXButton
click
wait 1

# Insert a checkbox control
log Inserting Check Box
find Check Box
click
wait 0.5

log Automation complete!
